author ai
group map
note How tours are placed in groups so the tours list is a tree instead of one flat list. A group is a field of the tour, a GroupName normalised when it is made, with / nesting one group in another; a group exists while a tour is in it. Map::rows orders the list once for both front ends: at each level the groups sorted by name, then the tours of that level in map order.

